        <fields>
            <name>Guidance</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;This flow will create a Case to the relevant agent that the Stock found on site does not match what the system &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(62, 62, 60);&quot;&gt;lists the&lt;/span&gt; merchant as having.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If the devices are of the correct model and their number matches what&apos;s in the Stock list but the serial numbers on one or more devices are mismatched, select &apos;Wrong Serial Number&apos;. If there are mismatches between model and quantity of devices (either less or more), select &apos;Stock not matching Contract&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
        </fields>
        <fields>
            <name>TypeSelection</name>
            <choiceReferences>WrongSerialNumber</choiceReferences>
            <choiceReferences>StockNotContract</choiceReferences>
            <dataType>String</dataType>
